WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
<v Aurelio Castellano>Thank you for calling Lantern, this call may be recorded.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.667
<v Folake Castellano>Hi, yeah, I need to reset sort of, my Lantern card PIN.

00:00:09.867 --> 00:00:13.333
<v Aurelio Castellano>I can help. Can I get your full name?

00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:15.733
<v Folake Castellano>Folake Castellano.

00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:20.267
<v Aurelio Castellano>And for verification, your social security number?

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:24.800
<v Folake Castellano>It's nine zero seven one two two three five eight.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.933
<v Aurelio Castellano>Sorry, could you repeat that?

00:00:28.133 --> 00:00:29.933
<v Folake Castellano>907-12-2358.

00:00:30.133 --> 00:00:33.400
<v Aurelio Castellano>Thank you. And your date of birth?

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.333
<v Folake Castellano>March 25th.

00:00:35.533 --> 00:00:40.667
<v Aurelio Castellano>Okay. The I mean, new card goes to the address in Mistral Bay?

00:00:40.867 --> 00:00:48.800
<v Folake Castellano>Yes. Oh and my number changed, it's eight six... I mean, eight four four five five five oh one five two.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.467
<v Aurelio Castellano>Got it. Anything else?

00:00:51.667 --> 00:00:59.267
<v Folake Castellano>No, wait, yes, I walked past a lantern on the way here and remembered basically, the branch closed.

00:00:59.467 --> 00:01:04.667
<v Aurelio Castellano>Right, that branch closed last month. Have a sort of, nice day.
